<title>UK: People's Bank unit sets asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>People's Bank unit sets asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>People's Bank Credit Card Master Trust Series 1997/1 has issued a $458.75 two-tranche, asset-backed bond, lead manager Goldman Sachs said on Friday.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $425 MLN	SPREAD    *11/12 BP  LEGAL MAT	JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	*1M LIBOR  PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  AVE LIFE    4.9 YEARS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    **	  LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	J.P. MORGAN, MORGAN STANLEY AND SALOMON BROTHERS ARE</p>
<p>		JOINT LEAD MANAGERS</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT    $33.75 MLN    SPREAD    *32 BP     LEGAL MAT	JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	*1M LIBOR  PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  **	  AVE LIFE    5 YEARS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    **	  LISTING     NONE</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> FEES TOTAL 0.29	DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> UND	  0.0575    MGT	  0.0575    SELL CONC   0.175</p>
<p> NOTES     *EXPECTED PRICING</p>
<p>	    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
